      "Saint Jude the Apostle": 1,
      "Jude was one of the Twelve apostles, not Judas Iscariot. At the Last Supper he asked Jesus why he would reveal himself to his disciples and not to the world. Jesus answered by speaking of love, keeping his word, and making a home with those who love him. Jude invites us to listen and live that love.": 1,
